              "answer": "30",
              "explanation": "The tens digit is 3, so 3 \u00d7 10 = 30."
            },
            "hint": "What is the tens digit? Multiply it by 10."
          },
          {
            "id": "MATH3_W01_D1_M2",
            "type": "numeric_fill",
            "question": "Write as a 3-digit number: 500 + 60 + 8 = __",
